# Recovery init additions for rodin (MediaTek MT6899).
#
# Keep this file minimal: every line runs before the recovery UI starts, so a
# mistake here is a boot failure instead of a cosmetic bug. Add MTK-specific
# sequences only after taking a log from a build that already boots.

on early-init
    mkdir /data 0771 system system

on boot
    mkdir /tmp 0777 root root
    mkdir /cache 0771 system cache
